    "notes": "The upstream Windows server is currently unmaintained. Its installer requires administrator privileges and may modify the SoftwareSASGeneration system policy. No VNC service is registered or started by this manifest; run 'winvnc4 -register' and 'winvnc4 -start' manually if desired."
